  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "January 2019 Steering Council election",
      "source_hash": 14198441822810318109,
      "context_hash": 16530898886277989957,
      "translation": "2019년 1월 운영 위원회 선거",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:39:18.861896Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Abstract",
      "source_hash": 14205428931693966264,
      "context_hash": 8576343278507092718,
      "translation": "초록",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:39:18.861901Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "This document describes the schedule and other details of the January 2019 election for the Python steering council, as specified in :pep:`13`.",
      "source_hash": 16369136290758616527,
      "context_hash": 13518294540570864035,
      "translation": "이 문서는 :pep:`13`\\ 에 명시된 2019년 1월 Python 운영 위원회 선거의 일정 및 기타 세부 사항을 설명합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:39:18.861902Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "This is the first steering council election.",
      "source_hash": 204335619226826271,
      "context_hash": 5226202853578580846,
      "translation": "이번 선거는 첫 번째 운영 위원회 선거입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:39:18.861902Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Returns officer",
      "source_hash": 12176661718629206489,
      "context_hash": 15500946223484796975,
      "translation": "개표 담당관",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:39:18.861902Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "In future elections, the returns officer will be appointed by the outgoing steering council.",
      "source_hash": 1097720793396884324,
      "context_hash": 11824452950139646265,
      "translation": "향후 선거에서는 퇴임하는 운영 위원회가 개표 담당관을 임명합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:39:18.861903Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Since this is the first election, we have no outgoing steering council, and :pep:`13` says that the returns officer is instead appointed by the PSF Executive Director, Ewa Jodlowska. `She appointed Ee Durbin <https://discuss.python.org/t/officially-appointing-the-returns-officer-for-the-steering-council-election/603>`__.",
      "source_hash": 16507993984095894091,
      "context_hash": 14354071007252706671,
      "translation": "이번 선거가 첫 번째 선거이므로 퇴임하는 운영 위원회가 없으며, :pep:`13`\\ 에서는 대신 PSF 집행 이사인 Ewa Jodlowska가 개표 담당관을 임명한다고 명시합니다. `그녀는 Ee Durbin을 임명했습니다 <https://discuss.python.org/t/officially-appointing-the-returns-officer-for-the-steering-council-election/603>`__.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:39:18.861904Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Schedule",
      "source_hash": 17730507104810335965,
      "context_hash": 8596276827532134096,
      "translation": "일정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:39:18.861904Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "There will be a two-week nomination period, followed by a two-week vote.",
      "source_hash": 1528394639829968729,
      "context_hash": 9257357129102490436,
      "translation": "2주간의 후보 추천 기간에 이어 2주간의 투표가 진행됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:39:18.861905Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "The nomination period is: January 7, 2019 through January 20, 2019",
      "source_hash": 6260241092170694743,
      "context_hash": 972023719739729184,
      "translation": "후보 추천 기간: 2019년 1월 7일부터 2019년 1월 20일까지",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:39:18.861905Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "The voting period is: January 21, 2019 12:00 UTC through February 4, 2019 12:00 UTC (The end of February 3, 2019 `Anywhere on Earth <http://www.ieee802.org/16/aoe.html>`_)",
      "source_hash": 3029738502570826252,
      "context_hash": 6556818063115430131,
      "translation": "투표 기간: 2019년 1월 21일 12:00 UTC부터 2019년 2월 4일 12:00 UTC까지 (2019년 2월 3일 `지구 어디서나 <http://www.ieee802.org/16/aoe.html>`_\\ 의 종료 시각)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:39:18.861905Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Candidates",
      "source_hash": 1549024387910241940,
      "context_hash": 15445846950123724496,
      "translation": "후보자",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:39:18.861906Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Candidates must be nominated by a core team member.",
      "source_hash": 15625689760213116169,
      "context_hash": 520011488141833222,
      "translation": "후보자는 핵심 팀 구성원이 추천해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:39:18.861906Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "If the candidate is a core team member, they may nominate themselves.",
      "source_hash": 334448297257708624,
      "context_hash": 14607126339886529214,
      "translation": "후보자가 핵심 팀 구성원인 경우 스스로를 추천할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:39:18.861906Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Once the nomination period opens, candidates will be listed here:",
      "source_hash": 5112914158038558104,
      "context_hash": 12481231122032353625,
      "translation": "후보 추천 기간이 시작되면 후보자는 여기에 나열됩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:39:18.861907Z",
      "issues": []
    },
